{{!
    @template mod_scormmakercmi5/player

    Player of an AnyWindow assignable unit: a link back to the activity, a full screen toggle (shown by the
    mod_scormmakercmi5/player module when the browser supports full screen) and the unit in an iframe titled with
    the unit title. The whole region goes full screen, so the toolbar stays reachable there.

    The link back first asks the unit to close (mod_scormmakercmi5/player, backLink) and leaves when it answers or
    after a timeout; the empty status region next to it announces that the learner is leaving meanwhile.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - Title of the unit, plain text.
    * url - Launch URL of the unit.
    * viewurl - URL of the activity page.
    * limitreached - Whether the registration reached the statement limit: the message is shown; otherwise it is
      rendered hidden, for the player module to show.
    * externalorigin - Origin of an AU outside the package (the learner is told it is hosted outside Moodle), or null.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Unit 1",
        "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/10/mod_scormmakercmi5/content/1/index.html",
        "viewurl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/view.php?id=5",
        "limitreached": false,
        "externalorigin": null
    }
}}
<div class="mod-scormmakercmi5-player" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-player">
    <div class="mod-scormmakercmi5-player-toolbar d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{viewurl}}" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-back">{{#str}} backtoactivity, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</a>
        <span class="accesshide" role="status" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-back-status"></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-fullscreen" aria-pressed="false" hidden>{{#str}} fullscreen, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</button>
    </div>
    {{#externalorigin}}
    <div class="alert alert-info mb-2" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-external">{{#str}} externalaulearner, mod_scormmakercmi5, {{externalorigin}} {{/str}}</div>
    {{/externalorigin}}
    <div class="alert alert-warning mb-2" role="alert" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-limit"{{^limitreached}} hidden{{/limitreached}}>{{#str}} statementlimitlearner, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</div>
    <iframe class="mod-scormmakercmi5-frame" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-frame" src="{{url}}" title="{{title}}" allow="fullscreen; autoplay"></iframe>
</div>
